From 4f56f5fc2645ff28b6df5008ee63b0471c066a87 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 15:21:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: stm32: rename stm32mp15 -scmi boards to nominal
 names

As SCMI is now the default boot configuration for stm32mp157a/c
boards, rename the -scmi suffixed board DTS files to base names:
  stm32mp157a-dk1-scmi -> stm32mp157a-dk1
  stm32mp157c-dk2-scmi -> stm32mp157c-dk2
  stm32mp157c-ed1-scmi -> stm32mp157c-ed1
  stm32mp157c-ev1-scmi -> stm32mp157c-ev1
Update the Makefile and DT bindings documentation accordingly.

Change-Id: I59a45299db5728be582736f8d48757503137c6a0
Signed-off-by: Valentin Caron <valentin.caron@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/593155
Domain-Review: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/stm32/stm32.yaml   | 9 +++++----
 arch/arm/boot/dts/st/Makefile                            | 8 ++++----
 .../st/{stm32mp157a-dk1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157a-dk1.dts} | 4 ++--
 .../st/{stm32mp157c-dk2-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-dk2.dts} | 4 ++--
 .../st/{stm32mp157c-ed1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-ed1.dts} | 4 ++--
 .../st/{stm32mp157c-ev1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-ev1.dts} | 4 ++--
 6 files changed, 17 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)
 rename arch/arm/boot/dts/st/{stm32mp157a-dk1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157a-dk1.dts} (92%)
 rename arch/arm/boot/dts/st/{stm32mp157c-dk2-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-dk2.dts} (93%)
 rename arch/arm/boot/dts/st/{stm32mp157c-ed1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-ed1.dts} (93%)
 rename arch/arm/boot/dts/st/{stm32mp157c-ev1-scmi.dts => stm32mp157c-ev1.dts} (91%)

